    10	// the map edge, and it sets the whole detail profile: blocks/texel =
    11	// 2 * (r + k) ^ 2 / (R * k). Steadfast shipped the plain 0.20 for its own
    12	// 160-block map (k = 32); reusing it at Astra's shipping 256 gives k = 51.2 and
    13	// halves near-field density. Anchoring on blocks keeps detail fixed while
